      "id": "1atRz",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2280,
      "name": "spec",
      "width": 720,
      "height": 420,
      "content": "MTB Aggregator — public UI (Home, Deals, Deal detail).\\n\\nPencil variables ≈ apps/web/src/app/globals.css:\\n• $background / $foreground — soft warm grey + near-black (light); neutral-warm grey (dark)\\n• $card, $muted, $border — low chroma (grey-first)\\n• $secondary — subtle grey band\\n• $accent — cool blue-grey wash\\n• $trail — muted teal accents\\n• $primary — hazard orange CTA\\n• $destructive — sale badges\\n• $radius ≈ 0.625rem\\n\\nTheme: frame theme { mode: light | dark }. Exports: designs/pencil-exports/*.png"
    }
  ],
